56
00:03:26,540 --> 00:03:30,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But the last ball doesn't show up on it.</font>

57
00:03:30,010 --> 00:03:33,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Maybe it flew into space or something?</font>

58
00:03:33,880 --> 00:03:37,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">They don't fly that far.</font>

59
00:03:37,150 --> 00:03:40,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It showed all seven while I
