66
00:04:02,980 --> 00:04:05,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Maybe an animal swallowed it!</font>

67
00:04:05,780 --> 00:04:08,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Maybe an alligator or a hippo
