68
00:04:08,550 --> 00:04:12,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If so, then doesn't that
mean our search is over?</font>

69
00:04:12,220 --> 00:04:13,960
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Pretty much.</font>

70
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:17,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There's nothing we can do.
Our only choice is to give up.</font>

71
00:04:19,330 --> 00:04:22,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Aw, man. Now what do I do?</font>

72
00:04:22,400 --> 00:04:27,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I got it! It might come out
when the animal takes a dump!</font>

73
00:04:27,400 --> 00:04:29,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What a disgusting way of putting it!</font>

74
00:04:29,540 --> 00:04:32,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But do you think it
would come out alright?</font>

75
00:04:39,350 --> 00:04:43,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">And I managed to finally
get six of them too...</font>

76
00:04:43,320 --> 00:04:48,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Just one more and I could've
brought Upa's dad back to life.</font>

77
00:04:52,290 --> 00:04:54,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If you went to Fortuneteller Baba's palace,</font>

78
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:59,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm sure she'd tell you
where the Dragon Ball is!</font>

79
00:04:59,230 --> 00:05:01,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Fortuneteller Baba's palace?</font>

80
