83
00:05:13,780 --> 00:05:15,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ouch!</font>

84
00:05:15,620 --> 00:05:17,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm sure she'll find it for you!</font>

85
