<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Your clothes are falling apart!</font>

123
00:08:12,280 --> 00:08:16,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I wore this the whole time I was fighting.</font>

124
00:08:16,650 --> 00:08:19,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're disgusting.</font>

125
00:08:19,320 --> 00:08:22,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey, let's buy new clothes for Goku!</font>

126
00:08:22,320 --> 00:08:26,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We might not get to see the
fortuneteller if he's too dirty!</font>

127
00:08:26,630 --> 00:08:29,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- Yeah! Let's do that!
- Yeah! Let's do that!</font>

128
00:08:30,500 --> 00:08:34,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">They don't really bother me, though...</font>

129
00:08:49,580 --> 00:08:52,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I hate these clothes!</font>

130
00:08:53,250 --> 00:08:54,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What will it be?</font>

131
00:08:54,860 --> 00:08:57,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll wear what I've been
wearing this whole time.</font>

132
00:08:57,790 --> 00:09:01,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Then shall I make a brand
