135
00:09:13,010 --> 00:09:16,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah! Put one on the
front where it's torn too!</font>

136
00:09:16,610 --> 00:09:19,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">And make a tail hole!</font>

137
00:09:19,110 --> 00:09:20,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yes, of course!</font>

138
00:09:22,720 --> 00:09:24,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So, how long will it take to make?</font>

139
00:09:24,920 --> 00:09:29,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well, seeing as this is such a
simple outfit, perhaps an hour or so...</font>

140
00:09:29,790 --> 00:09:31,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Also, um...</font>

141
00:09:31,660 --> 00:09:35,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Could you use the
cheapest cloth you have?</font>

142
00:09:35,260 --> 00:09:37,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Certainly.</font>

143
00:09:37,500 --> 00:09:39,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now what, Goku?</font>

144
00:09:39,170 --> 00:09:42,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What do you say we hang out in a coffee
