145
00:09:42,140 --> 00:09:44,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm up for that!</font>

146
00:09:44,970 --> 00:09:48,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">In that case, I'll go
bring Upa back here!</font>

147
00:09:48,810 --> 00:09:53,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay? Because we almost
have all the Dragon Balls!</font>

148
00:09:53,050 --> 00:09:54,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Upa'll be so happy!</font>

149
00:09:54,620 --> 00:09:57,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ah, that might be a good idea!</font>

150
00:09:57,720 --> 00:09:59,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Kinto Un</i>!</font>

151
00:10:06,030 --> 00:10:09,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Make sure you come back
here without getting lost!</font>

152
00:10:09,530 --> 00:10:11,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay!</font>

153
00:10:40,330 --> 00:10:42,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There it is!</font>

154
00:10:47,470 --> 00:10:49,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Upa!</font>

155
00:10:49,040 --> 00:10:52,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Are you here?! It's me!</font>

156
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:55,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey!</font>

157
00:11:05,020 --> 00:11:07,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">G-Goku-<i>san</i>?</font>

158
00:11:10,560 --> 00:11:12,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Upa!</font>

159
00:11:14,490 --> 00:11:19,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It really was you, Goku-<i>san</i>!</font>

160
00:11:21,070 --> 00:11:22,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Upa!</font>

161
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:28,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm so glad! You're alive!</font>

162
00:11:28,210 --> 00:11:32,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'd never die! I beat up
the entire Red Ribbon Army!</font>

163
00:11:33,510 --> 00:11:38,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I've been praying this entire time!</font>

164
00:11:38,090 --> 00:11:39,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Listen, Upa.</font>

165
00:11:39,790 --> 00:11:45,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I only need one more Dragon Ball until
I can bring your dad back to life!</font>

166
